<title>NORWAY: Norway extends concession to Poland's LOT airline.</title>
<headline>Norway extends concession to Poland's LOT airline.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway has extended a concession to Poland's LOT Polish Airlines to fly its Warsaw to Oslo route for a further five years until March 31, 2002, a statement from the Transport Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
